WEBVTT

00:13:28.810 --> 00:13:31.412
ne shume llojshmeri mjedisore

00:13:31.412 --> 00:13:33.233
dhe ne mund te mesojme nga kjo

00:13:33.233 --> 00:13:35.010
per sisteme te tjera qe operojne

00:13:35.010 --> 00:13:37.347
pa kontroll qendror.

00:13:37.347 --> 00:13:39.326
Duke perdorur vetem nderveprime te thjeshta,

00:13:39.326 --> 00:13:41.121
kolonite e miliongonave kane qene duke performuar

00:13:41.121 --> 00:13:44.754
"amazing feat"(film vizatimor) per me shume se 130 milion vite.

00:13:44.754 --> 00:13:46.894
Ne kemi shume per te mesuar nga ato.

00:13:46.894 --> 00:13:49.632
Faleminderit

00:13:49.632 --> 00:13:52.365
(Duartroktije)